    <section class="page-header" style="padding: 140px 0 60px;"><div class="bg-gradient-animated"></div><div class="container"><p style="color:#93c5fd; font-size:0.85rem; font-weight:600;">BLOG</p><h1 style="font-size:2.6rem; font-weight:800; color:#fff; margin:0.5rem 0 1rem;">Sentiment Analysis of Video Reviews</h1><p style="font-size:1.15rem; color:#cbd5e1; max-width:700px;">How AnalyzeG extracts sentiment scores, keyword themes, and insights from verified video reviews.</p><div class="header-accent"></div></div></section>
    <section style="background:#fff; padding:60px 0;"><div class="container" style="max-width:900px; line-height:1.8; color:#475569; font-size:1.05rem;">
      <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Video reviews carry signals that text cannot capture: facial expressions, tone of voice, product handling, and the physical context of use. AnalyzeG processes these signals through a pipeline that produces actionable sentiment data for your Power BI dashboard.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin:2rem 0 1rem;">The Sentiment Pipeline</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;"><strong>1. Verification First:</strong> Every video passes 5-point face-presence verification + human moderation before analysis. Only verified reviews enter the sentiment pipeline.</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;"><strong>2. Video Content Analysis:</strong> The system analyzes visual cues (product handling, environment, reviewer expression) and audio signals (tone, pace, emphasis) to generate a sentiment score.</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;"><strong>3. Keyword Extraction:</strong> Themes and topics are extracted from the video content — product features, use cases, comparisons, and emotional responses.</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;"><strong>4. Demographic Enrichment:</strong> Sentiment data is tagged with state, age, and gender demographics for segmented analysis.</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:2rem;"><strong>5. Dashboard Delivery:</strong> Results are visualized in your Power BI dashboard with filters, trend charts, and exportable data tables.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin:2rem 0 1rem;">What You See in Power BI</h2>
      <div style="display:grid; gap:0.75rem; margin:1.5rem 0;">
        <p style="color:#475569;">Overall sentiment distribution (positive / neutral / negative)</p>
        <p style="color:#475569;">Top keyword themes per video</p>
        <p style="color:#475569;">Sentiment by demographic (state, age, gender)</p>
        <p style="color:#475569;">Competitor mention frequency</p>
        <p style="color:#475569;">Sentiment trend over time</p>
        <p style="color:#475569;">Individual video sentiment scores with timestamps</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#f0f9ff; border:1px solid #bfdbfe; border-radius:12px; padding:2rem; margin:2rem 0;"><h3 style="font-size:1.2rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e40af; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Get Sentiment Intelligence</h3><p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Projects starting at ₹5L with sentiment analysis. Power BI included. Final quote after scoping call.</p><a href="https://app.analyzeg.co.in/" style="display:inline-block; background:#2563EB; color:#fff; padding:12px 24px; border-radius:8px; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none;">Launch App &rarr;</a></div>
